  "description": "##T1.Bay Tree Rear Garden: The Tree has outgrown its location Dismantle in sections using rigging equipment to a level as close as possible to the surrounding soil, and treat the stump with eco-plugs to help prevent regrowth. ##T2. Himalayan Birch Rear Garden: Reduce the height by 2.5m and the lateral spread by 1m to create a natural and balanced form. ##G3. Winter Flowering Cherry x 2 Rear Garden: Fell in sections to ground level and treat stump with eco-plugs to help prevent regrowth. ##T4.Ginkgo Tree Rear Garden: Remove or subordinately prune the codominant stem, reduce height by 2 m, and lightly shape to balance the crown.",
